Description: Live service inventory via sc queryex (all states)
Category: LiveResponse
Author: KapeIR / IR Phase1
Version: 1.1
Id: a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-ab12-cd34ef567809
ExportFormat: txt
Processors:
    -
        Executable: C:\Windows\System32\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\powershell.exe
        CommandLine: -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File "%kapeDirectory%\Modules\bin\Invoke-Utf8Capture.ps1" -Exe "sc.exe" -Arguments "queryex type= service state= all" -OutputFile "%destinationDirectory%\services_all.txt"
        ExportFormat: txt

# Documentation
# Full service list including stopped services (complements PsService / net start).
# UTF-8 via Invoke-Utf8Capture.ps1 (OEM CP866 → UTF-8).
# https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/administration/windows-commands/sc-query
